{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<id<MLNAnnotation>>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" * "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visibleAnnotations"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The objects in this array must adopt the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol. If no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations are associated with the map view or if no annotations associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the map view are currently visible, the value of this property is "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/visibleannotations"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The complete list of annotations associated with the receiver that are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"currently visible."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/visibleAnnotations"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"visibleAnnotations","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapView.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/s